// Columbiana County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. The Leetonia library (blocks automated fetching) was checked in
// a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The July file's school list linked publicschoolsk12.com, an aggregator; each
//     district's own site is listed instead.
//   * The county links page sends "City of Columbiana" to cityofcolumbiana.org,
//     which now shows Columbiana, ALABAMA; the city is columbianaohio.gov.
//   * East Liverpool Municipal Court has closed; cases go to the Columbiana County
//     Municipal Court in Lisbon.
//   * The county portal still links columbianaboe.org (stale since 2019); the Board
//     of Elections is columbiana.boe.ohio.gov.
//   * East Liverpool City Hospital is part of Prime Healthcare. aaa11.org now
//     redirects to Direction Home of Eastern Ohio. elchamber.com is for sale; the
//     East Liverpool chamber is the River Valley Chamber.
//   * visitcolumbianacounty.com no longer loads; the Commissioners' and Sheriff's
//     own domains do not load either.
//   * Guilford Lake is fully drawn down for dam rehabilitation (2026).
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Columbia County NY/PA/GA/FL; Columbiana ALABAMA; Wellsville UT/NY
//   (wellsvilleareachamber.com is New York); Salem MA/OR; cswcd.specialdistrict.org
//   is Oregon. thereviewnewspapers.com is a Mahoning Valley weekly, not East
//   Liverpool's Review (reviewonline.com).
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Three cities (Salem, East Liverpool, Columbiana; Salem and Columbiana reach
//     into Mahoning), villages including East Palestine (a village, not a city),
//     Wellsville and Minerva (mostly Stark), and eighteen townships.
//   * West Branch (Mahoning) and Minerva (Stark) districts take in parts of the
//     county.
//   * Three health districts: county, Salem City and East Liverpool City.
//   * The solid waste district is shared with Carroll and Harrison; workforce
//     services are shared with Mahoning (MCTA).
//
// LEFT OUT rather than listed unverified: the Engineer, Sanitary Engineer, Board of
// DD, SWCD, Regional Planning and Land Bank (no own sites found), the Park
// District, the southern United Way and Lisbon chamber (Facebook only), Second
// Harvest and Habitat (service area not confirmed), and WOHI (its listed site is
// hijacked).

